      "lines": [
        "I. $\\operatorname{tg}x=2,\\ x=\\operatorname{arctg}2+\\pi n,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$，",
        "$x\\approx1.11+\\pi n,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$。",
        "II. $\\operatorname{tg}x=1,\\ x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k,\\ k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例5　解方程",
        "$3\\sin^2x-4\\sin x\\cos x+\\cos^2x=0$。　(2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于这个方程，可以利用半角的正切公式，然后再解所得",
        "到的双二次方程。但是已知方程可以比较简单地求解。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程左边的每一项都是关于变量 $y$ 和 $z$ 的二次单项式，",
        "其中 $y=\\sin x$，$z=\\cos x$。这就是说，它是关于正弦和余弦的",
        "二次齐次方程。正弦和余弦不可能同时等于零。因此，使这",
        "两个函数当中的一个变成零的自变量的值不是这个方程的",
        "解。所以可以用 $\\cos^2x$（或 $\\sin^2x$）除方程的两边，从而得到与",
        "方程(2)同解的方程："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$3\\operatorname{tg}^2x-4\\operatorname{tg}x+1=0$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\operatorname{tg}x=1$ 或 $\\operatorname{tg}x=\\frac{1}{3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi n,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "或"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\operatorname{arctg}\\frac{1}{3}+\\pi n,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一次齐次方程，例如方程 $\\sin x+2\\cos x=0$，以及三次齐",
        "次方程，例如 $\\sin^3x+2\\sin^2x\\cos x-3\\sin x\\cos^2x+2\\cos^3x"
      ]
    },
